1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,912
Many people confuse being busy with being productive.

2
00:00:03,862 --> 00:00:08,037
Start each day by choosing the three tasks that matter most.

3
00:00:08,037 --> 00:00:12,200
Protect one hour of deep work without messages or calls.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:16,187
At the end of the day, review what actually moved forward.

